    "description": "Sheaffer\nFerrari Official Licensed Product - Rosso Corsa Fountain Pen\n2017 Production, Complete Gift Set\nThis Sheaffer Ferrari fountain pen represents a collaboration between the legendary Italian automaker and the historic American writing instrument manufacturer. Finished in the iconic Rosso Corsa red, the pen features the Scuderia Ferrari \"Prancing Horse\" shield on the clip and the Sheaffer White Dot of quality. Established in 1913, Sheaffer has long been synonymous with high-quality writing instruments, and their partnership with Ferrari brings a sporty, modern edge to their classic designs. This model reflects the sleek lines associated with Ferrari racing heritage, combined with Sheaffer's smooth-writing engineering.\nOfficial Ferrari Licensed Product with holographic authentication seal (No. 240411816)\nRosso Corsa matte red finish with polished chrome appointments\nIncludes original Ferrari branded presentation box and outer sleeve\nTwo Sheaffer ink cartridges included (Blue and Black)\nSheaffer White Dot hallmark on clip alongside the Ferrari Shield\nCondition:\nExcellent condition, appears unused. The finish is pristine with no chips, scratches, or signs of wear. The clip is tight and aligned. Ink cartridges are sealed and included. Presentation box and outer sleeve show minimal storage wear.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
