    "description": "Title\n: Decatur Industries Pipe Stand Tobacco Jar Set With 2 Smoking Pipes Walnut Glass\nBrand\n: Decatur Industries\nColor\n: Brown/Clear\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nDepartment\n: Collectibles\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nDescription\n: Elevate your smoking accessories with this refined Decatur Industries pipe stand, featuring a genuine walnut wood base and matching lid. The set includes a clear, ribbed glass humidor jar, ideal for keeping pipe tobacco fresh, and provides dedicated slots to neatly hold up to four pipes, with two classic pipes included in this listing. One pipe has a rusticated, textured bowl with a dark finish and visible metal band, while the other showcases a smooth wood bowl and minimalist banding. The entire set displays mid-century craftsmanship and a timeless, organized look suitable for any collector or enthusiast's display. The wooden base is marked with an original Decatur Industries label, confirming the material as genuine walnut. All items show visible signs of previous use, such as light wear and a patina consistent with age, particularly on the pipes' stems and bowls. The glass jar is clean but may show minor interior markings from prior use. A classic piece that adds practicality and charm to any decor\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
